**2. Create/Open `.gitignore` and paste this:**
```text
# Ignore compiled C/C++ binaries
workloads/mmult
workloads/*.o
workloads/*.out

# Ignore gem5 simulation output directories
m5out/
stats.txt
config.ini
config.json

# Ignore OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ignore VS Code settings (optional, but good practice)
.vscode/